  "reviewed_note_changes": "Frame notes describe the common frame and fixed datums. Servo-mount labels/service notes now allow paired bridge replacement. DriveContract changes only frame SKU plus the bridge SKU. Two unresolved-interface descriptions address the new seating, warp, clamping and creep risks. New bridge notes require removing both small gears, lifting0.5mm and sliding80mm; new fastener notes correctly state5mm grip,1.2mm nut and1.8mm nominal tip. Every existing equipment, rail, optical and procurement note remains unchanged.",
